    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then why doesn't it feel like moving?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Think of a smooth car ride. You can't feel the speed, only the bumps and stops.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🚗",
