    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So the Earth never speeds up or slows down?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Right! It keeps the same steady speed, every day. So your body can't tell it's moving.",
      "punch": "steady",
      "board": {
